WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.533
Following Ash's victory at the Lumiose Gym,

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.733
earning his fifth Kalos Gym Badge,

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.933
our heroes are on their way to visit Professor Sycamore's lab

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.966
before heading to Laverre City.

5
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.533
How does it look? You think you can fix it?

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.966
Piece of cake. I'll have it done in a jif! Could you hand me that rag, please?

7
00:00:25.966 --> 00:00:29.300
Ah! There's something marvellous about motor oil.

8
00:00:29.366 --> 00:00:32.900
I've got important research coming up, so I'm depending on you.

9
00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:37.833
You're talking to me here! You're in the best of hands!

10
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.166
- Professor Sycamore? Hello?
- Hello?

11
00:00:43.233 --> 00:00:45.900
- How nice. Welcome!
- Professor!

12
00:00:45.966 --> 00:00:50.633
You timed it perfectly. I'm planning to do a very interesting experiment today.

13
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.400
Yippee! What kind of experiment?

14
00:00:52.466 --> 00:00:55.866
You'll find out when the time comes.

15
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

16
00:00:57.866 --> 00:00:59.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

17
00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:03.066
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

18
00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:04.533
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

19
00:01:04.599 --> 00:01:08.366
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

20
00:01:08.433 --> 00:01:11.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

21
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:15.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

22
00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:19.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

23
00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:23.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

24
00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:26.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

25
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:31.033
Garchomp's Mega Bond!

26
00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:40.400
They're right over here. I finally managed to obtain one of each!

27
00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.900
-It's a Key Stone and a Mega Stone!

28
00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.866
Gardevoir! Now Mega Evolve!

29
00:01:50.933 --> 00:01:56.866
Gardevoir!

30
00:01:59.466 --> 00:02:02.466
I know each Pokémon requires its own Mega Stone.

31
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:05.133
So which Pokémon is this Mega Stone for?

32
00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.266
An excellent question, Clemont.

33
00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:10.466
Today's experiment is designed to provide us with the answer.

34
00:02:10.533 --> 00:02:13.466
So, if you're ready, this synchroniser should do the trick.

35
00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:16.933
Now, one, two, three.

36
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.933
- We'll find out in no time!
- Great!

37
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.100
First, we take our Mega Stone and place it here on the pedestal.

38
00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:27.100
I wish Alain were here to see this.

39
00:02:27.233 --> 00:02:30.833
Professor? What about Dedenne? Can Dedenne Mega Evolve?

40
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.000
Denne-ne! Denne!

41
00:02:32.066 --> 00:02:34.900
- And what about Pikachu?
- Pikachu.

42
00:02:34.966 --> 00:02:37.500
Well, the fact is, Pikachu could still evolve,

43
00:02:37.566 --> 00:02:39.433
so Mega Evolution won't work.

44
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.900
It's possible Dedenne could Mega Evolve.

45
00:02:41.966 --> 00:02:44.900
Yay! Try! Try!

46
00:02:44.966 --> 00:02:47.400
- Garchomp!
- Oh Garchomp, hey, there!

47
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:51.900
Gar, gar. Garchomp. Garchomp.

48
00:02:51.966 --> 00:02:55.000
What is that? That is a Mega Stone.

49
00:02:55.066 --> 00:02:57.133
- Professor?
- Huh?

50
00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:00.200
- The synchroniser is reacting!
- Really?

51
00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:04.933
That means the Mega Stone is a genuine Garchompite!

52
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.933
That means we'll get to see Garchomp Mega Evolve!

53
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.233
I'm so psyched! It's gonna be great!

54
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.166
- Pika, pika!
- Denne!

55
00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:14.900
-What's going on?

56
00:03:14.966 --> 00:03:19.966
- All the Pokémon!
- Professor Sycamore!

57
00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.600
-Pika!

58
00:03:22.666 --> 00:03:25.366
- What's that?

59
00:03:27.666 --> 00:03:29.233
What's going on?

60
00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:31.900
We're taller than you, so show some respect!

61
00:03:31.966 --> 00:03:34.500
Though manners are things that twerps always neglect!

62
00:03:34.566 --> 00:03:36.733
To show the secrets of Mega Evolution!

63
00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.533
Stealing your work seems the perfect solution!

64
00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:42.466
The art of cunning is our labour of love!

65
00:03:42.533 --> 00:03:45.233
Your findings send us to the stars above!

66
00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.800
- Jessie!
- And James.

67
00:03:47.866 --> 00:03:51.100
Team Rocket makes Mega Evolution a breeze!

68
00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:54.300
A mega-mega heist that is destined to please!

69
00:03:54.366 --> 00:03:57.900
Meowth sure agrees!

70
00:03:57.966 --> 00:04:00.533
Team Rocket! You guys again?

71
00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.966
We heard every mega-morsel!

72
00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:07.366
Since Garchomp and Garchompite equals one Mega-Evolved party, we want in!

73
00:04:07.433 --> 00:04:10.966
- So let the celebration begin.
- Party time, teamsters!

74
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.600
We seal this deal and we'll rule the world!

75
00:04:15.666 --> 00:04:16.933
Hm.

76
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.533
Joy! Key Stone spotted!

77
00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.533
- Meowth, get your paws on it!
- With pleasure!

78
00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.366
- Oh, no!
- Pika!

79
00:04:29.433 --> 00:04:33.000
- The other stone, too!
- Yee-ha!

80
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.200
-Pika!

81
00:04:36.266 --> 00:04:38.200
The Garchompite!

82
00:04:38.266 --> 00:04:41.700
Now all that's left is grabbin' Garchomp.

83
00:04:41.766 --> 00:04:44.100
- Gar!
- Garchomp, you stay back!

84
00:04:44.166 --> 00:04:46.933
- Pikachu, Thunderbolt!
- Pika!

85
00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.933
- We could grab Pikachu, too.
- Just for you!

86
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.800
Our Pokémon-nabbin' net!

87
00:04:51.866 --> 00:04:54.966
- Pika!
- Garchomp!

88
00:04:55.033 --> 00:04:57.100
Man. It slipped right through the net.

89
00:04:57.166 --> 00:04:59.300
Well, Garchomp is still a worthwhile catch.

90
00:04:59.366 --> 00:05:02.366
- Up, up and away!
- It's time to go home!

91
00:05:02.433 --> 00:05:05.400
I'll give it the gas.

92
00:05:05.466 --> 00:05:08.766
Enjoy the exhaust!

93
00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:13.366
Come back! Garchomp's not yours!

94
00:05:13.433 --> 00:05:16.333
- Hey, Ash! Stick this onto their bot!
- OK!

95
00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.733
Huh? What in the world...

96
00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.766
- It can't be.
- They made off with everything.

97
00:05:32.833 --> 00:05:36.533
Huh? Hey, what did I throw?

98
00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.766
The future is now, thanks to science!

99
00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:42.133
Clemontic Gear, on!

100
00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.900
I thought we'd encounter a situation precisely like this one!

101
00:05:45.966 --> 00:05:48.133
I call it Search in a Second!

102
00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.100
Well, we know what's it's for.

103
00:05:50.166 --> 00:05:54.133
This device will track the transmitter Ash attached to the rocket robot.

104
00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.633
And then we'll know where they are!

105
00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:00.200
-Found it! It's travelling northwest!

106
00:06:00.266 --> 00:06:03.933
- Sophie! Let Officer Jenny know, please?
- Right!

107
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.766
We'll use your device to track down Team Rocket!

108
00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:09.566
- I'm counting on you!
- Right!

109
00:06:11.066 --> 00:06:14.000
- Northwest. Are you sure?
- No doubt!

110
00:06:14.066 --> 00:06:17.300
-Positive! Just keep going straight!

111
00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.533
Gar! Gar!

112
00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.333
We got both the Mega Stone and the Key Stone.

113
00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:38.233
- Nothing can stop us now.
- Gar!

114
00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:41.733
The Mega Stone, Meowth, stat!

115
00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:47.166
- I can't get this stupid thing to budge!
- Leave it to Inkay! What do you say?

116
00:06:48.866 --> 00:06:50.100
Inkay!

117
00:06:50.166 --> 00:06:54.600
- All right, ease that case towards Inkay.
- A-OK!

118
00:06:54.666 --> 00:06:58.133
Inkay!

119
00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:03.333
The signal's getting stronger. We're getting closer!

120
00:07:09.433 --> 00:07:11.000
Are you all right, Clemont?

121
00:07:11.066 --> 00:07:14.300
They must have done something to sabotage the synchroniser,

122
00:07:14.366 --> 00:07:15.866
which made my device explode!

123
00:07:15.933 --> 00:07:18.566
Who cares about that technical stuff?

124
00:07:18.633 --> 00:07:21.533
Professor!

125
00:07:23.233 --> 00:07:28.966
Garchomp, hello? Garchomp, if you can hear me, then answer!

126
00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:31.866
Garchomp!

127
00:07:31.933 --> 00:07:36.000
Garchomp!

128
00:07:38.433 --> 00:07:42.366
All right, Garchomp. This stone goes on you.

129
00:07:42.433 --> 00:07:45.366
All right, Meowth, you ready to roll?

130
00:07:45.433 --> 00:07:47.366
Ready-eddy-eddy!

131
00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:50.133
Are you sure it's safe to make Garchomp Mega Evolve?

132
00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:53.233
It wouldn't be good for our health if it started acting up.

133
00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:57.133
Of course, and that's precisely why we employ a mind-control ray.

134
00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.766
Meowth, old chum? Time to keep Garchomp calm!

135
00:08:01.833 --> 00:08:05.100
No prob! Be a good Pokémon. Chill!

136
00:08:06.233 --> 00:08:08.900
Meowth!

137
00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:21.566
Good. I'm letting Garchomp out of its cage.

138
00:08:21.633 --> 00:08:26.333
Right this way...

139
00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:31.333
Nice Garchomp. Calmness is goodness.

140
00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:35.566
We're all set! All right, the moment we've all been waiting for.

141
00:08:35.633 --> 00:08:40.333
- Garchomp! Mega Evolve, now!
- Gar, gar.

142
00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:45.266
-What a hoot!

143
00:08:45.333 --> 00:08:49.000
With the Mega-Evolved Pokémon conquering the world isn't a dream!

144
00:08:49.066 --> 00:08:51.666
Team Rocket finally grabs the brass ring!

145
00:08:51.733 --> 00:08:54.266
Which will make the Boss pleased as punch.

146
00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:57.500
And it's all because we're goin' with the Mega flow!

147
00:08:57.566 --> 00:09:03.066
As we bask in the Mega Evolution glow!

148
00:09:05.133 --> 00:09:08.166
Who's that Pokémon?

149
00:09:12.133 --> 00:09:14.166
It's Garchomp!

150
00:09:14.233 --> 00:09:15.700
Garchomp!

151
00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:22.566
The signal from the transmitter was definitely nearby!

152
00:09:22.633 --> 00:09:25.433
Then let's go the rest of the way on foot.

153
00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.333
Professor! You've gotta treat its wounds! Please.

154
00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.500
Gible! Gible!

155
00:09:36.566 --> 00:09:39.500
- What happened?
- It was running wild in town.

156
00:09:39.566 --> 00:09:43.500
Don't worry. It's OK. You must be hungry, right?

157
00:09:43.566 --> 00:09:47.000
You don't need to worry.

158
00:09:47.066 --> 00:09:52.100
- Professor! It's Gible!
- Huh?

159
00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:57.733
Gi. Gi. Gible.

160
00:09:59.866 --> 00:10:01.600
Please don't be afraid.

161
00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:11.800
Don't worry. I'm not your enemy.

162
00:10:13.966 --> 00:10:16.100
Gi?

163
00:10:16.166 --> 00:10:19.200
- Aah.
- Gible.

164
00:10:19.266 --> 00:10:21.066
- Gible.
- Mm.

165
00:10:22.166 --> 00:10:25.833
Gi! Gible! Gi! Gible!

166
00:10:29.966 --> 00:10:34.033
-Marvellous!

167
00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:37.500
Brilliant! This is wonderful, Gabite!

168
00:10:37.566 --> 00:10:39.300
Psyduck!

169
00:10:42.333 --> 00:10:45.766
Gabite!

170
00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.766
- A-ha!
- Oh!

171
00:10:53.366 --> 00:10:57.266
- Gab!
- You did it, Garchomp!

172
00:10:57.333 --> 00:10:59.466
Gabba!

173
00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:05.000
My friend Garchomp.

174
00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.833
Gar. Gabba.

175
00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.533
Don't worry.

176
00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:21.200
Marvellous!

177
00:11:24.566 --> 00:11:27.166
My Garchomp.

178
00:11:27.233 --> 00:11:28.766
Gabba!

179
00:11:28.833 --> 00:11:32.000
- Huh.
- All right, what went wrong?

180
00:11:32.066 --> 00:11:36.000
Beats me. We have both the stones necessary to Mega Evolve.

181
00:11:36.066 --> 00:11:38.600
Which means something went wrong.

182
00:11:38.666 --> 00:11:42.100
Gabba!

183
00:11:43.633 --> 00:11:46.900
Gabb... Gabba!

184
00:11:46.966 --> 00:11:48.000
Huh?

185
00:11:48.066 --> 00:11:49.566
- Professor?
- Huh?

186
00:11:49.633 --> 00:11:52.300
- That sound just now.
- What are you talking about?

187
00:11:52.366 --> 00:11:54.733
I'm certain that I heard Garchomp just now!

188
00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.466
Huh?

189
00:11:56.533 --> 00:11:59.866
- Professor. I didn't hear a thing.
- Pika! Pika!

190
00:11:59.933 --> 00:12:02.300
- Me neither.
- Denne-ne!

191
00:12:02.366 --> 00:12:05.133
I'm sure that I heard it! Huh?

192
00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.133
That way! Garchomp's over there!

193
00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.333
- How do you know that?
- I can't really explain it.

194
00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:13.133
Somehow, I just know!

195
00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.533
But how?

196
00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.933
Many people say there's a mysterious connection

197
00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.366
between trainer and Pokémon that science simply can't explain.

198
00:12:20.433 --> 00:12:22.166
- Yeah.
- Pika.

199
00:12:22.233 --> 00:12:24.100
Let's follow his lead!

200
00:12:27.166 --> 00:12:31.966
Mega Evolve! Do it now! Garchomp, work with me!

201
00:12:32.033 --> 00:12:36.000
Jess, most likely Garchomp doesn't really want to work with us.

202
00:12:36.066 --> 00:12:39.300
- Then just change its mind!
- Huh? Change its mind...

203
00:12:39.366 --> 00:12:42.066
All right! We'll just crank up the mind-control ray!

204
00:12:42.133 --> 00:12:44.300
Turn it up as far as it will go!

205
00:12:44.366 --> 00:12:47.700
We've got to control Garchomp even if we have to buy more batteries!

206
00:12:47.766 --> 00:12:51.333
No need for that.

207
00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:57.200
Gar...

208
00:12:59.166 --> 00:13:02.466
- Professor Sycamore! Look!
- It looks like Mega Evolution!

209
00:13:02.533 --> 00:13:04.533
- Huh?
- Let's go!

210
00:13:07.066 --> 00:13:10.133
No, Garchomp!

211
00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.133
- Hm.
- Oh, drat! It's Sycamore!

212
00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:15.133
- Stop it!
- If it isn't the good professor.

213
00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:19.933
I knew I'd find you! I could feel you calling for me!

214
00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:24.333
- Argh! Heroics are so annoying!
- You're out of time.

215
00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.666
Put another log on the mind-control fire! Higher!

216
00:13:27.733 --> 00:13:30.066
I've got it on 11 already.

217
00:13:33.266 --> 00:13:37.600
- Stop it now!
- Professor Sycamore!

218
00:13:37.666 --> 00:13:39.366
- Let's go, Pikachu!
- Pika!

219
00:13:39.433 --> 00:13:41.766
- Ash, wait!
- Pika!

220
00:13:41.833 --> 00:13:43.666
Aaargh!

221
00:13:50.566 --> 00:13:53.433
Mega Blaziken, stop their mind-control ray!

222
00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:57.400
Blaziken! Blaz!

223
00:13:57.466 --> 00:13:58.866
Blaziken Mask!

224
00:13:58.933 --> 00:14:00.933
- Mega Blaziken!
- Pika!

225
00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.766
Huh?

226
00:14:03.833 --> 00:14:05.933
- Bellyache Mask.
- Blaz!

227
00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:09.033
It's one pain after another! What are you waiting for?

228
00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.266
We need more power!

229
00:14:10.333 --> 00:14:13.933
Cool your jets, Jessie, I'm giving it all I've got!

230
00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.266
Meowth!

231
00:14:16.333 --> 00:14:19.266
Gabba!

232
00:14:19.333 --> 00:14:23.766
If Garchomp Mega Evolves, Team Rocket wins. They can't!

233
00:14:23.833 --> 00:14:25.733
They must be stopped!

234
00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.800
I won't let that happen!

235
00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:33.133
Huh? That's it! Blaziken Mask, please lend me your Key Stone!

236
00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:35.100
Huh?

237
00:14:35.166 --> 00:14:38.733
Garchomp and I have a bond they don't have.

238
00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:41.733
- I'll make it Mega Evolve before them!
- Huh?

239
00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:43.733
As you wish.

240
00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:46.233
- Blaziken!
- Blaziken!

241
00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:55.000
- If using this can help, go right ahead!
- Thanks a lot, Blaziken Mask.

242
00:14:58.066 --> 00:15:05.000
- Now, Garchomp.
- Mega Evolve!

243
00:15:08.066 --> 00:15:13.500
Gar! Gabba!

244
00:15:13.566 --> 00:15:15.166
Clemont, what's going on?

245
00:15:15.233 --> 00:15:18.000
Both Key Stones are simultaneously affecting Garchomp!

246
00:15:18.066 --> 00:15:20.966
They're both trying to get it to Mega Evolve!

247
00:15:21.033 --> 00:15:24.533
Gabba!

248
00:15:25.566 --> 00:15:29.733
The bond between Garchomp and Professor Sycamore has gotta be stronger!

249
00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:32.533
- Pika!
- Right. It is.

250
00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:33.600
Blaziken!

251
00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.800
Gabba!

252
00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.533
Blaz!

253
00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.533
- Huh?
- What happened?

254
00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.966
Hey! What's going on?

255
00:15:58.033 --> 00:16:01.300
Can you hear me?

256
00:16:01.366 --> 00:16:05.500
Our mind-control ray's doing its job. Garchomp's under our control.

257
00:16:05.566 --> 00:16:08.100
That's not possible!

258
00:16:08.166 --> 00:16:10.633
From now on, you'll answer to us.

259
00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:14.633
You're a member of Team Rocket. Through and through!

260
00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:18.100
No way! Garchomp is my friend!

261
00:16:18.166 --> 00:16:22.733
Now, first things first. Show them to the proverbial door!

262
00:16:25.733 --> 00:16:26.733
Hm.

263
00:16:30.933 --> 00:16:32.733
Garchomp, please.

264
00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.033
- It's not looking too good.
- Pika.

265
00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.100
I know!

266
00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.566
Garchomp. I have faith in you.

267
00:16:46.633 --> 00:16:48.266
Professor!

268
00:16:54.933 --> 00:16:56.866
Huh?

269
00:16:58.766 --> 00:17:02.333
- You're all right! Ah!
- Gabba!

270
00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.833
- Of all the nerve!
- Hey! Injustice!

271
00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.733
- Yeah!
- He did it!

272
00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:08.733
- Hm.
- Ken.

273
00:17:14.833 --> 00:17:18.533
- Now I'd say it's payback time.
- Gabba!

274
00:17:20.966 --> 00:17:24.400
- Garchomp, destroy their rocket bot!
- Gabba!

275
00:17:24.466 --> 00:17:25.666
Incoming!

276
00:17:26.833 --> 00:17:30.033
Gabba!

277
00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.466
Hey! I'm freezin'!

278
00:17:36.533 --> 00:17:38.900
- Aah!
- I feel a blast-off in our future.

279
00:17:38.966 --> 00:17:42.566
- Then let's change it.
- Hai-yah!

280
00:17:42.633 --> 00:17:45.133
There's nothing like an emergency getaway scheme.

281
00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:48.766
- Especially rocket-propelled.
- Full speed!

282
00:17:48.833 --> 00:17:52.500
- Oh no! They're getting away!
- Not this time!

283
00:17:52.566 --> 00:17:55.633
- That's right. Blaziken!
- Blaziken!

284
00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:59.000
- Mega Garchomp, let's go!
- Gabba!

285
00:17:59.066 --> 00:18:01.800
- Ready, Pikachu?
- Pika!

286
00:18:01.866 --> 00:18:04.800
All right! It's a triple attack!

287
00:18:04.866 --> 00:18:06.700
Gotta fly!

288
00:18:06.766 --> 00:18:08.000
Use Flamethrower!

289
00:18:08.066 --> 00:18:10.366
- Use Hyper Beam!
- Use Thunderbolt!

290
00:18:10.433 --> 00:18:13.166
Blaziken!

291
00:18:13.233 --> 00:18:15.166
Gabba!

292
00:18:15.233 --> 00:18:19.333
Pikachu!

293
00:18:25.366 --> 00:18:30.033
A triple-strength blastoff is three times the embarrassment!

294
00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.600
Ah!

295
00:18:45.933 --> 00:18:48.866
- You were marvellous, Garchomp!
- Garchomp.

296
00:18:48.933 --> 00:18:51.933
- Buddy, you were great!
- Pika, pika!

297
00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.366
- Pikachu's so strong!
- Denne-ne!

298
00:18:54.433 --> 00:18:58.466
Ah. Something marvellous about motor oil. Huh.

299
00:18:58.533 --> 00:19:02.966
Blaziken Mask, thanks. You were a big help! Both of you.

300
00:19:03.033 --> 00:19:04.433
Hm.

301
00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.766
-Huh?

302
00:19:06.833 --> 00:19:08.433
- Pika!
- Look!

303
00:19:10.466 --> 00:19:14.466
- Professor, how's Garchomp?
- It's safe and sound.

304
00:19:14.533 --> 00:19:17.400
- Everything's been figured out.
- Figured out?

305
00:19:17.466 --> 00:19:21.200
Yeah, see, Blaziken Mask went wham, bam! Now everything's fine.

306
00:19:21.266 --> 00:19:22.466
- Where is he?
- Huh?

307
00:19:23.266 --> 00:19:25.000
Gone.

308
00:19:28.833 --> 00:19:31.466
Professor Sycamore, thank you for everything!

309
00:19:31.533 --> 00:19:34.166
- See you later, Garchomp.
- Pika, pika!

310
00:19:34.233 --> 00:19:35.966
- See you!
- Denne!

311
00:19:36.033 --> 00:19:37.833
Garchomp.

312
00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.900
Make sure to come and visit us again really soon!

313
00:19:41.966 --> 00:19:42.966
Gabba!

314
00:19:43.033 --> 00:19:46.733
Now that our heroes have witnessed Garchomp Mega Evolve,

315
00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:49.733
their awe at its power is greater than ever!

316
00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:53.366
And now, it's off to Laverre City...

317
00:19:53.433 --> 00:19:54.966
- Professor?
- Hm?

318
00:19:55.033 --> 00:19:57.033
I'm afraid it happened again.

319
00:19:59.033 --> 00:20:03.600
Things always break when they visit, don't they?

320
00:20:07.766 --> 00:20:09.600
- Hm.

321
00:20:11.633 --> 00:20:12.700
Huh?

322
00:20:12.766 --> 00:20:15.500
- Hello Meyer.
- Professor!

323
00:20:15.566 --> 00:20:20.133
Ah! As I said, there's something quite marvellous about motor oil.

324
00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:22.933
I'll bet you're havin' electrical problems again.

325
00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:24.933
Want me to come over this afternoon?

326
00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.866
Not quite. I came over about something else.

327
00:20:28.933 --> 00:20:29.933
Hm?

328
00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.933
What do you think? Mega Blaziken.

329
00:20:33.766 --> 00:20:38.666
Would you help me with my research with Mega Blaziken?

330
00:20:38.733 --> 00:20:39.933
Hm.

331
00:20:45.166 --> 00:20:48.533
..as the journey continues!
